<title>POLAND: PPWK Q3 NET JUMPS TO PLN 2.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>PPWK Q3 NET JUMPS TO PLN 2.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>PPWK SA results for the third</p>
<p>quarter ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>					    Q3 1996	 Q3 1995</p>
<p>    operating				3.64   vs    2.84</p>
<p>    pre-tax				  3.45   vs    2.60</p>
<p>    net					2.11   vs    1.42</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Polskie Przedsiebiorstwo</p>
<p>Wydawnictw Kartograficznych SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				9.14   vs    7.72</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 4.01   vs    3.74</p>
